@startuml target_help_metadata_classes
title Help Metadata Detail - Supplement to the Global Command Diagram
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/execution/CommandExecutionContext.java session and catalog.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeManager.java prepareCached, toIdentity:630, toRuntime:646, AgentIdentity:717.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/PreparedAgentRuntime.java metadata.
' Observed behavior: the identity cache omits userCases; reload currently returns an empty list.
' Design reason: move cache and response detail out of the global diagram without hiding the global responsibility chain.
' Target-only: Help adapters, query service, DTOs, response projection and cache completion are confirmed targets.

class CommandExecutionContext <<request snapshot>>
class HelpCommandHandler <<singleton>>
class AgentHelpQueryService <<application service>> #E3F2E1 {
  +query(agentId): AgentHelpDTO
}
class AgentRuntimeManager <<singleton>> {
  +prepareCached(agentId)
}
class PreparedAgentRuntime <<complete snapshot>> #E3F2E1
class "AgentIdentity / agent.json" as AgentIdentity <<stored metadata>> {
  name / displayName
  description[]
  userCases[]
}
class "AgentHelpDTO / HelpResultDTO" as HelpData <<immutable request data>> #E3F2E1
class CommandResponseAssembler <<singleton>>
class AgentHelpResponseVO <<target-only immutable response>> #E3F2E1 {
  displayName
  description[]
  userCases[]
}

HelpCommandHandler ..> CommandExecutionContext : authorized Session binding
HelpCommandHandler --> AgentHelpQueryService : agentId
AgentHelpQueryService --> AgentRuntimeManager : one cached read
AgentRuntimeManager --> PreparedAgentRuntime : complete snapshot
AgentRuntimeManager --> AgentIdentity : publish / reload
AgentHelpQueryService ..> HelpData : whitelist projection
CommandResponseAssembler ..> HelpData : result DTO
CommandResponseAssembler ..> AgentHelpResponseVO : business VO

note bottom of AgentIdentity
Keep userCases on save and reload.
Old cache: explicit refresh outside Help.
Read and publication share the Agent lock.
end note

note bottom of AgentHelpResponseVO
Exactly three business fields; absent text is [].
No command discriminator or internal receipt.
No prompt, bindings, or runtime objects.
end note

legend bottom left
This is a Help-only detail view, not the global Command structure.
Help uses authored Agent metadata, not the command catalog.
No model/tool call, implicit refresh, Session Entry or execution lease.
CommandExecutionContext retains the common request catalog.
DTOs belong to runtimeapi.dto.command; VOs to runtimeapi.vo.
endlegend
@enduml
